&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced Private Medical Insurance and a Health Cash Back Plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance &amp;amp; disability benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan with 4% Company match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive time off package with 25 Days of PTO, 8 Company-paid Holidays, 2 paid floating holidays (new in 2026!), 10 paid sick days, 2 Wellness days and 1 Paid Volunteer Day&lt;/li&gt;
